<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-W WINS PLN 1.7 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-W WINS PLN 1.7 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Mostostal Warszawa SA won a 1.7-million-zloty contract to build a workshop for central-Polish cable maker Fabryka Kabli w Ozarowie, Mostostal said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said work on the project would start on September 15.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
